Verified presentation gaps on the Nexus detail page, smallest-first. All API facts
live-verified 2026-08-07 unless marked.

- Per-file changelogs: v2 modFiles.changelogText ([String], live-populated) - render
  in DownloadsTab per file. Mod-level: v1 changelogs.json (doc-verified,
  version -> notes map) can back a Changelog tab like ModWorkshop's. Both authed.
- Version in browse/search: add version to SEARCH_QUERY (live-verified populated) -
