  v2 media query cannot filter by mod (MediaSearchFilter has gameId/type/owner only),
  so a mod's site gallery is not reachable. Scraping the website for it is NOT an
  acceptable fallback (AUP; see nexus-policy-boundaries). Single pictureUrl stays the
  honest ceiling until Nexus answers question 2. If they expose it later: disk-cache
  via the thumbnails full-URL-keying work, CSP already allows staticdelivery/images
  hosts - re-audit both csp and devCsp at that point.

Modules: nexus.rs (selection sets), domain.rs (wire fields), ModDetailPage /
DownloadsTab / NexusBrowsePage, i18n. Sequencing: any of these can ship independently;
none needs the source restructure.

